{"title":"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/5/f0542d0f6559f822332cdffd13ef7e8449965294.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x^2 - 4| &lt; N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"19\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/a/71a1bd8a9f6232f5e9b2c0ca4562e85542883f31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x - 2| &lt; 0.01$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />, the smallest value we can use for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/e/8fe38db757f523d8e4286e295ce36dc1d38d0cb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ .0301 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) }\\ .0349 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) }\\ .0399 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D) }\\ .0401 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }\\ .0499\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"535\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are two cases: (i) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/c/3dc828ccc49b1db88554d8b26839e3940d177848.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-2&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" /> and (ii) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/a/30a15917770d4053b19a1d9ef7e221b468fc736c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-2&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />. In case (i), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/7/6f75c5c402df1ce31f6342cae135f74c9e0a04d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x-2&lt;0.01$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/3/e13490ef15140f242e0c34be47539191f6170cd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4&lt;x+2&lt;4.01$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"15\" />. In case (ii), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/7/ab7aa8e956776fede7a0e5af7f75372c0c90d44f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-0.01&lt;x-2&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/c/20cd79d1ebbb771776972f6e712a4962890c0c8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.99&lt;x+2&lt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"15\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/8/e382ff1bd672451c92b6e58e523be0ee909eda23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> in case (i) can take a larger value, we use it to determine the upper bound for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/f/4bf8d0864a7cf85161d460e29c0d3c0273314da1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x^2-4|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"61\" height=\"21\" /> under the given restrictions. Now, we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/e/b3e5634f49aa5c600bb9b61e084274bf945642d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x^2-4|=|x-2||x+2|&lt;0.01*4.01=\\boxed{0.0401}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"381\" height=\"25\" />, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/e/8de616f86c4a1dee1e38a5bc9da93b27b1790fa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME\" title=\"1965 AHSME\">1965 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1965 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1965\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AH